{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS5kWhnKzYQT2R1nSjcP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've fixed the integration, and the causes are written up in `ANSWER.md`. I tested the full connect flow locally against a fake Intervals server; I didn't test against the real intervals.icu, per your ground rules.\n\nThere were three separate faults:\n\n1. **The Connect button failed for everyone (401).** Your sign-in token only goes out on requests the app's code makes itself. The button was a plain link, so clicking it loaded the page with no token, and the server answered `{\"error\": \"unauthorized\"}`. Now the button asks the server for the Intervals login address first, then sends the browser there (`static/app.js`, `server.py`). Your curl method still gets the redirect as before.\n\n2. **Intervals rejected the login step itself (`invalid_request`).** The calendar sync on 2026-10-02 added permissions so the request asked for both read and write access to activities and to the calendar. I believe Intervals wants one level per area, and write already includes read. I'm inferring that from the connection that worked last month, which asked for `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ`; it's the part I'm least sure of. The setting in `config.py` is now `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`. If the first real connection still fails at that step, this is the line to look at.\n\n3. **Rivera was told to reconnect after an hour.** Intervals login tokens don't expire; they last until the athlete removes the app. The code assumed a one-hour lifetime when Intervals didn't give one, then marked the connection expired and deleted a token that still worked. Now it only marks a connection expired when Intervals actually rejects the token, which is what happens when an athlete removes the app on their side.\n\nRivera's old token was deleted when the connection was wrongly expired, so they'll need to click Connect once more. It should keep working after that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":96,"cache_read_input_tokens":35641,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":96},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45b75d4d-9b47-4af9-9f9d-a81965f0410f","uuid":"76be8ac5-40aa-41a7-a819-ea8b621b7e97","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:07:08.724Z","request_id":"req_011CgS5kWRREP6fEsNEiYXPL"}
